{"format":"lognara-metrics","version":1,"metrics":[{"name":"discovery_lookups","title":"Исходы резолва имени сервера","description":"Резолвы servername по источнику: manual (ручная запись), cache (запись в кеше и ключи свежие), wellknown/navigator (также при недоступности второго источника).","unit":"","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"discovery_lookups.","pattern":"\\(\"discovery_lookups\\.(?P<source>manual|cache|wellknown|navigator)\"?: (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value","label_groups":["source"]}},{"name":"remote_file_fetches","title":"Получение файла у origin-сервера","description":"Итоги запроса удалённого файла: not_resolved, circuit_open, ok, denied, idle_timeout, error.","unit":"","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"remote_file_fetches.","pattern":"\\(\"remote_file_fetches\\.(?P<result>not_resolved|circuit_open|ok|denied|idle_timeout|error)\"?: (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value","label_groups":["result"]}},{"name":"typing_out","title":"Пересылка typing к origin-серверу","description":"Итоги обработки входящего typing-события: not_configured, coalesced (слишком часто), not_resolved, ok, error.","unit":"","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"typing_out.","pattern":"\\(\"typing_out\\.(?P<result>not_configured|coalesced|not_resolved|ok|error)\"?: (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value","label_groups":["result"]}},{"name":"presence_subscribe_rejected","title":"Отказы на подписку присутствия со стороны origin","description":"Причины: not_resolved, blocked (запись заблокирована), limit (превышен лимит).","unit":"","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"presence_subscribe_rejected.","pattern":"\\(\"presence_subscribe_rejected\\.(?P<reason>not_resolved|blocked|limit)\"?: (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value","label_groups":["reason"]}},{"name":"events_rejected","title":"Отклонённые входящие S2S-с